Z||000000||ggarsk||06-17-2000||10:14 AM||||For all you members with a Iron Duke. If your engine idles rough and runs real rich,you might want to take off your throttle body and clean out the passge for the EGR. I just had mine off and it was completely plugged up with carbon. It made a world of diference in the way it runs.||||reg||1
